# The Legend of Kuruk: "I, II - Scry 2, then draw a card. III - Exile this Saga, then return it to the battlefield transformed
# under your control." Chapter I (turn 1): scry 2 sees Forest and Mountain, keeps Forest on top and bottoms Mountain, and the draw
# is the Forest. Chapter II (turn 3, after the draw step takes Swamp): scry 2 sees Tropical Island and Volcanic Island, bottoms both,
# and the draw is Misty Rainforest. Chapter III (turn 5): the Saga is exiled and returns as Avatar Kuruk (CR 712.14a), a colorless
# legendary Avatar creature 4/3 - a new object, so it has no lore counters and is no Saga.

